        {
            "title": "Bad news",
            "date": "2017-04-03 09:37:28",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/75840229390719534",
            "content": "[img]http://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/26356959/cad2eb52c8308f0c15e11f9304526b12ce7a08d0.gif[/img]\r\n\r\nDue to evident lack of interest towards the HHH project, it is once again suspended for an indefinite period of time.\r\nThis weekend has proved that we overestimated the visitors’ interest for the project. Over 25,000 unique users have visited the [URL=http://store.steampowered.com/app/618090/]HHH: Day of Judgment[/URL] page on April 1-2 but only 6 people have joined the [URL=http://steamcommunity.com/groups/hhh_bw2]group[/URL]. For the moment there are as few as 30 members in the group, including the developers.\r\n"
        },
