        {
            "title": "Trading Cards have been added!",
            "date": "2017-01-05 07:32:54",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/84839823695832588",
            "content": "If you have purchased any items(not DLCs) BEFORE Trading Cards addition, even just $1 one and already sold it - you would get 3 card drops out of 5. To get them you have to spend approximately 5 minutes per card in the game.\r\n\r\n[b]For new players.[/b]\r\nBy Steam rules everyone is eligible for 1 card drop per $ 9 spent on items from \"Support Bloody Walls\" section. Unfortunately, Steam does not include payed DLCs in that sum as far as i know, but it's possible to craft Trading Cards booster pack from gems if you wish.\r\n\r\nFor more details about Steam rules see here, part about \"free to play games\": http://steamcommunity.com/tradingcards/faq"
        },
