        {
            "title": "Need to wait a bit longer.",
            "date": "2016-11-03 06:29:18",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/182787402039904394",
            "content": "[img]http://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/26356959/a26bd71572642790a4ebcc83e2ec84211771fcab.png[/img]\r\n\r\nAlthough the add-ons are ready, we are having a bit of a problem connecting these DLC's to the original game. In particular, the API used by our game does not support checking for DLC's, so we'll need some time to figure out how to fix this problem. The ETA for this release is November 9, 2016."
        },
        {
            "title": "Need to wait a bit longer.",
